// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Trolls_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1449281054" "I've been hearing a lot of reports about Troll robberies lately. As bad as the Troll are when they're hopped up on Superadine, they're even worse when they're in withdrawal! They'll knock over banks, newsstands, supermarkets; anything to get a quick fix! The worst thing is, these thefts usually end in violence. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to hit the streets and show the Trolls you won't tolerate their thieving.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P804993370" "Hit the streets and show the Trolls you won't tolerate their thieving"
// SendOffString :
"P2666177425" "Skyway City and Boomtown have been hit the hardest. If I were you, I'd probably start in one of those zones."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1068601056" "Combat Troll menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1579743109" "I'm still hearing reports of Trolls ransacking local businesses. I need you to do something about that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P357606961" "You have discouraged the Trolls from stealing to pay for their Superadine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1679268631" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I'm sure Paragon City's businessmen can all breathe a sigh of relief."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Trolls_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3861426680" "Have you heard of those Troll rampages in Skyway City? According to my reports, each Troll takes a heavy dose of Superadine, enough to make him nearly insane with fury. Then they hit the streets and destroy everything in sight. It's some sort or recreation for them! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get to Skyway City and stop the Troll rampages.</a> If you can't, that zone won't be safe for people or property."
// AcceptString :
"P779021110" "Go to Skyway City and stop the Troll rampages"
// SendOffString :
"P332597714" "Hide Park and the Land of the Lost have been hit recently. You might look for Trolls there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P580593192" "Combat Trolls in Skyway City"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2944221538" "I just got a report of another drug-induced rampage. I thought you were going to do something about those Trolls!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3425216477" "You have discouraged the Trolls from their drug-induced rampages."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P859051937" "The Trolls embrace all the effects of Superadine, both positive and negative. It's their willingness to subject themselves to the drug's ravages that makes them such an overwhelming force."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_Trolls_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1722433970" "The neighborhood watch in Boomtown has been reporting a lot of Troll assaults lately. It seems that the Trolls' enhanced strength and endurance has given them a feeling of superiority, and they're eager to prove that it's justified. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You need to get over to Boomtown and make sure the Trolls know we won't stand for assaults on our citizens.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P682031117" "Go to Boomtown and make sure the Trolls know you won't stand for assaults on citizens"
// SendOffString :
"P313649040" "The Trolls like to hang out in Primer and the Fuze. Those are the neighborhoods I'd start with, if I were you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1935367003" "Combat Trolls in Boomtown"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3968345437" "The Trolls are still assaulting citizens in Boomtown. Get over there!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3572567709" "You have discouraged the Trolls from assaulting the citizens of Boomtown."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P843951085" "Thanks, {HeroName}. The Trolls will think twice before throwing their weight around in Boomtown again."
